Review this diff implementing Story 2.1 "Sitzplan grafisch darstellen" (seat plan rendering) for a ticket-booking web app (Angular 22 + TypeScript frontend, ASP.NET Core 10 + EF Core 10 + SQL Server backend). It adds a new Sitzplatzbelegung (seat occupancy) entity + EF migration, a GET /veranstaltungen/{id}/sitzplan endpoint that computes seat-plan geometry (rows/columns/aisles) server-side, and a new Angular buchung route/component that renders the seat plan with a seat-tile child component (free/occupied visually distinguished by color+icon, aria-labels, skeleton loading state, horizontally scrollable with sticky row labels).

Walk every branching path and boundary condition (empty rooms, rooms with all-aisle columns, malformed GangSpalten, route param edge cases, race conditions between page loads, network error timing, etc). Report only unhandled edge cases as a plain Markdown list, each with a one-line title and the evidence/reasoning. Do not fix anything, this is review-only.

